  "behaviour": [
    "One port for whatsapp; provider not chosen yet (owner item); tests and agent runs use a stand-in that records sends.",
    "Every send uses a stored template (plain short words, no emojis, R8) and is written to the delivery log; inbound delivery receipts update status.",
    "Sends are jobs with retries; a send carries an idempotency key so a retry never sends twice.",
    "Receivers are messaged only to deliver the wish and the publishing notice (T-75).",
    "Business-initiated messages need provider-approved templates; approvedRef stores the provider's template id."
